  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hackathon Designing Hydrogen Valleys in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A two-day, online hackathon named &quot;Designing Hydrogen Valleys in India&quot; was organised, focussing on a number of specific issues in the development of green hydrogen valleys in India. As a result of the event, businesses and knowledge institutes were connected. Also, the bilateral relation between India and the Netherlands in the field of green hydrogen was strengthened.As a follow-up to this activity, an Indian delegation visited the Netherlands and its hydrogen valleys in November 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
